      solution: `$P(${c.A}) = ${dec2(pA)}$ et $P_{${c.A}}(${c.B}) = ${dec2(pBA)}$, donc $P(${c.A} \\cap ${c.B}) = ${dec2(pA)} \\times ${dec2(pBA)} = ${dec2(inter)}$, soit ${i}.`
