        aides: [`Al-Kashi donne ${formCos}.`, `$\\cos ${Ah} = \\dfrac{${c * c} + ${b * b} - ${a * a}}{2 \\times ${c} \\times ${b}}$.`, "Calcule, puis simplifie la fraction."],
